{
    "comment": "분류 삭제 확인 창. 브랜드 쪽 같은 이름의 창은 여는 쪽이 `_global.modal_data` 에 실어 준 값을\n  읽지만, 이 창은 선택된 분류(`_global.selectedCategory`)를 직접 본다 — 여는 자리가 한 곳뿐이고\n  그 시점에 이미 선택이 잡혀 있어서다. 잠금 판단도 그 안의 `children_count`/`products_count` 를\n  쓴다(관계 배열 길이를 세는 것보다 정확하다 — 응답이 관계를 안 실어도 수는 온다).\n  막는 사유가 둘이다: 하위 분류가 있거나 연결된 상품이 있으면 삭제 버튼이 잠기고, 두 사유가\n  겹치면 안내 목록에 두 줄이 함께 뜬다.\n  삭제 후 트리와 **활성 분류 목록을 둘 다** 다시 부른다 — 뒤엣것은 상품 폼 같은 다른 화면의\n  선택지라, 지운 분류가 그 목록에 남으면 없는 분류로 저장이 나간다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Category Delete Confirm Modal"
    },
    "id": "modal_delete_confirm",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.title",
        "size": "medium",
        "footer": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "closeModal"
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "text": "$t:common.cancel"
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Button",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "comment": "삭제 실행. `isDeleting` 이 버튼 잠금과 라벨을 함께 쥐고 있어 성공·실패 양쪽에서 모두\n            풀어야 한다 — 한쪽만 풀면 실패 후 버튼이 \"처리 중\" 인 채 잠긴다.\n            성공 갈래 순서가 화면 복구 순서다: 트리·활성목록 갱신 → 패널 비우기 → 알림 → 창 닫기.",
                        "type": "click",
                        "handler": "sequence",
                        "actions": [
                            {
                                "handler": "setState",
                                "params": {
                                    "target": "local",
                                    "isDeleting": true
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "handler": "apiCall",
                                "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/categories/{{_global.selectedCategoryId}}",
                                "auth_required": true,
                                "params": {
                                    "method": "DELETE"
                                },
                                "onSuccess": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "local",
                                            "isDeleting": false
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                        "params": {
                                            "dataSourceId": "categories"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                        "params": {
                                            "dataSourceId": "activeCategories"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "global",
                                            "panelMode": "empty",
                                            "selectedCategoryId": null,
                                            "selectedCategory": null
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "success",
                                            "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.messages.deleted"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "closeModal"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "onError": [
                                    {
                                        "handler": "setState",
                                        "params": {
                                            "target": "local",
                                            "isDeleting": false
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "handler": "toast",
                                        "params": {
                                            "type": "error",
                                            "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "type": "button",
                    "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-red-700 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-red-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                    "disabled": "{{_local.isDeleting || (_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0) > 0 || (_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0) > 0}}"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{!_local.isDeleting}}",
                        "text": "$t:common.delete"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Span",
                        "if": "{{_local.isDeleting}}",
                        "text": "$t:common.loading"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{(_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0) === 0 && (_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0) === 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:text-base"
                            },
                            "text": "{{$localized(_global.selectedCategory?.name)}}{{$t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.message_can_delete')}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{(_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0) > 0 || (_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0) > 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-text-primary ecommerce:text-base"
                            },
                            "text": "{{$localized(_global.selectedCategory?.name)}}{{$t('sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.message_cannot_delete')}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{(_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0) > 0 || (_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0) > 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:bg-yellow-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-900/20 ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-yellow-200 ecommerce:dark:border-yellow-700 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:p-4"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:gap-3"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:flex-shrink-0 ecommerce:mt-0.5"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "exclamation-triangle",
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-xl ecommerce:text-yellow-700 ecommerce:dark:text-yellow-400"
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:flex-1"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "P",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce-tone-warning-soft ecommerce:mb-2"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.cannot_delete_title"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Ul",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:list-disc ecommerce:list-inside ecommerce:space-y-1 ecommerce-tone-warning-soft ecommerce:text-xs"
                                                    },
                                                    "children": [
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Li",
                                                            "if": "{{(_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0) > 0}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.has_children_cannot_delete|count={{_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0}}"
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "type": "basic",
                                                            "name": "Li",
                                                            "if": "{{(_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0) > 0}}",
                                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.has_products_cannot_delete|count={{_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0}}"
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "if": "{{(_global.selectedCategory?.children_count ?? 0) === 0 && (_global.selectedCategory?.products_count ?? 0) === 0}}",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400 ecommerce:font-medium"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.category.delete_modal.irreversible_warning"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
